{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさまこんばんは！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"北野日奈子です(｡・・｡)♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"天気のいいお昼にお散歩にいきたい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たくさん歩いて\nいろいろなパン屋さんいきたい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"人がたくさん並んでるパン屋さんも\n素敵で行きたいけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"人が並んでない隠れ家みたいなパン屋さんを\nみつけて美味しいパンを見出せた時の\n幸福感を味わってみたい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さんがそういう\n人とは違う何かを見つけたり聞いたりして\n幸福に感じたことって\nどんなことがありますか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日、みり愛と絢音と取材してもらったのですが、\nみり愛も絢音も私が知らない間に\nしっかりしてて感動した！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いや！もともと私よりしっかりしてたし\n誰目線だよ！ってなるけど、\nそれでもなんか私も\n負けてられないって思いました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そーだね、、、\n悩む時期とかどうしたらいいかわからなくて\n進むべき道が見えなくなることも\nたくさんあるし\nそういう時の気持ちに切り替え方も\n私はまだまだできないけど、\nもっとがんばりたい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"二期生！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"二期生がいてくれて\n二期生が乃木坂にはいってくれて\n二期生がこのメンバーでよかった"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"っていつか言ってもらえるように！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも、二期生という名の\n縛りはされたくないんだ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/11/04/2408611/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"若しゃん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/11/04/2408611/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"真夏さんがこっちみてる！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"このあと\n真夏さんと3人でもとったよ♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/11/04/2408611/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あしたは、ミュージックステーションに\n乃木坂46出演します！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんみてくださいね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/11/04/2408611/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ついに！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"サンクエトワール"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"君に贈る花がない"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"のMVが公開されましたね！！！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どうでしたかー？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どう感じられましたかー？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんの意見を聞いてから\n私も気持ちを話します！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ただ、本当に嬉しかった！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"サンクエトワール再結成！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"サンクエトワールだけで\n去年みたいにまたいろいろできたらいいな！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やっぱり、サンクエトワールでも\nがんばりたいよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"がんばろう！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/11/04/2408611/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それでは、きょうはこのへんで！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おやすみなさい！"}],"source":"archive"}